# Security response headers — Netlify/Cloudflare Pages format.
# Apply these rules at your custom-domain proxy (Cloudflare Transform Rules,
# Netlify, Vercel, etc.).
# HSTS and X-Frame-Options only take effect as real HTTP headers — meta-tag
# equivalents are ignored by browsers.

